              "formula": "If([Discount Pct] >= 75, \"75 or Above\", If([Discount Pct] >= 50, \"50 to 74\", If([Discount Pct] >= 25, \"25 to 49\", If([Discount Pct] >= 10, \"10 to 24\", If([Discount Pct] >= 0, \"0 to 9\", \"Below 0\")))))",
